+
+
+
+/*
+ *----------------------------------------------------------------------
+ *
+ * SVGA3D_SetScissorRect --
+ *
+ *      Set the current context's scissor rectangle. If scissor
+ *      is enabled then all rendering is clipped to the scissor.
